const S = {"C": {"type": "object", "properties": {"checks": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}}, "required": ["checks"]}, "ALT": {"type": "object", "properties": {"poems": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "note": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["poems", "note"]}, "P": {"type": "object", "properties": {"poem": {"type": "string"}, "lib_calls": {"type": "integer"}}, "required": ["poem", "lib_calls"]}}
phase('Ход')
const out = {}
const ph = PIPES.map(t => async () => { const a = await agent(t.first, {label: t.id + '|1', phase: 'Ход', schema: S.P}); out[t.id + '|1'] = a;
  const b = await agent(t.pre + String(a ? a.poem : '(стихотворения нет)') + t.post, {label: t.id + '|2', phase: 'Ход', schema: S.P}); out[t.id + '|2'] = b })
const jh = JOBS.map(j => async () => { out[j.id] = await agent(j.prompt, {label: j.id, phase: 'Ход', schema: S[j.schema]}) })
await parallel([...ph, ...jh])
return {out}
